.TH JOT 1
.SH NAME
jot \- graphical scratch text editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B jot
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Jot
is a small graphical text editor.
It uses the draw and frame libraries, supports mouse and keyboard text
editing, and can send selections to the plumber.
.PP
Button 2 opens a command menu.
The
.B plumb
command sends the selected text, or nearby text if there is no
selection, to the plumber.
.SH SOURCE
.B /sys/src/cmd/jot
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR acme (1),
.IR sam (1),
.IR plumb (6)
